# Cube of size 1 centred on the origin, made to be seen from INSIDE.
# Normals point inwards; triangles are counter-clockwise seen from inside.
# Texture coordinates follow a cross-shaped cube net on one image (4 x 3
# squares):
#        .     TOP     .      .
#       LEFT  FRONT  RIGHT  BACK
#        .   BOTTOM    .      .
# Folded with the printed side inwards: seen from inside, every face reads
# the right way round and neighbouring squares meet along the same edges as
# on the paper.
# FRONT is the face at z = -0.5 (straight ahead of a camera at the origin
# looking down -Z),
# TOP is at y = +0.5.

o Room

